乱，不要硬拼贴，不要模板化背景，不要廉价奇幻素材- 保持克制高级的版式，致敬而不煽情\n**签名：**画面中需自然加入专属签名，作为海报设计的一部分，位置低调但清晰，风格需与整体版式统一，像收藏版海报的作者落款或设计签章。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 11, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#27364a", "widgets_values": ["节点#11 CR Prompt Text\n作用：输出一段固定文本提示词，供下游生成或处理节点直接读取使用。\n参数：\n- prompt：当前值=Main subject in realistic cosplay style in foregr…；作用：主编辑提示词，描述目标结果；范围：字符串，建议 1 ~ 2048 字符；默认：空字符串。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5b7f", "size": [240, 190], "pos": [0.1024850606918335, 866.309814453125], "id": 15, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "apikey", "links": [7], "label": "apikey", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "apikey"}], "size": [240, 140], "pos": [-4.663827419281006, 1110.1837158203125], "widgets_values": ["zhenzhen", "sk-D4NfgFaI1WJzhsNSxKJo9nhLmoZB1GoF420MiMtR3y9j1fYO", ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "api_base"}, "name": "api_base", "label": "api_base", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "api_base"}, {"widget": {"name": "apikey"}, "name": "apikey", "label": "apikey", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "apikey"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_ip"}, "shape": 7, "name": "custom_ip", "label": "custom_ip", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_ip"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 10, "type": "Comfly_api_set", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Comfly_api_set"}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [535.1516129112117, 69.17723881973677], "scale": 0.6588450000000021}}, "group